			<heading>
				Job Replies: The Wicked Do Prosper
			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">Then Job answered and said :</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">and let this be your comfort .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">and after I have spoken ,<crossref let="l" cid="c18021003.1" />mock on .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">Why should I not be impatient ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">and<crossref let="n" cid="c18021005.1" />lay your hand over your mouth .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">and shuddering seizes my flesh .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">reach old age , and grow mighty in power ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">and their descendants before their eyes .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">and<crossref let="r" cid="c18021009.2" />no rod of God is upon them .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">their cow calves and<crossref let="s" cid="c18021010.1" />does not miscarry .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">and their children dance .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">and rejoice to the sound of<crossref let="v" cid="c18021012.2" />the pipe .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">and in<crossref let="x" cid="c18021013.2" />peace they go down to<crossref let="y" cid="c18021013.3" />Sheol .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">We do not desire the knowledge of your ways .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">And what<crossref let="b" cid="c18021015.2" />profit do we get if we pray to him ? ’</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">
				<crossref let="c" cid="c18021016.1" />The counsel of the wicked is far from me .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">That God distributes pains in his anger ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">and like<crossref let="f" cid="c18021018.2" />chaff that the storm carries away ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021019">
			</marker>
			<v n="19">Let him pay it out to them , that they may<crossref let="i" cid="c18021019.3" />know it .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021020">
			</marker>
			<v n="20">and let them<crossref let="j" cid="c18021020.1" />drink of the wrath of the Almighty .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021021">
			</marker>
			<v n="21">when<crossref let="k" cid="c18021021.1" />the number of their months is cut off ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021022">
			</marker>
			<v n="22">seeing that he<crossref let="m" cid="c18021022.2" />judges those who are on high ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021023">
			</marker>
			<v n="23">being wholly at ease and secure ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021024">
			</marker>
			<v n="24">and<crossref let="n" cid="c18021024.1" />the marrow of his bones moist .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021025">
			</marker>
			<v n="25">never having tasted of prosperity .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021026">
			</marker>
			<v n="26">and<crossref let="q" cid="c18021026.2" />the worms cover them .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021027">
			</marker>
			<v n="27">and your schemes to wrong me .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021028">
			</marker>
			<v n="28">Where is<crossref let="s" cid="c18021028.2" />the tent in which the wicked lived ? ’</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021029">
			</marker>
			<v n="29">and do you not accept their testimony</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021030">
			</marker>
			<v n="30">that he is rescued in the day of wrath ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021031">
			</marker>
			<v n="31">and who<crossref let="v" cid="c18021031.2" />repays him for what he has done ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021032">
			</marker>
			<v n="32">watch is kept over his tomb .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021033">
			</marker>
			<v n="33">and those who go before him are innumerable .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021034">
			</marker>
			<v n="34">There is nothing left of your answers but falsehood . ”</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18021035">
			</marker>
